      "updated": 1757415503292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Version control system Security Controls\n- Git hooks\n- - Local repo: pre-commit etc.\n- - Remote repo:  pre-receive, post-receive\n- GitLab branch protections\n- Separation of duties: merge request approval\n- Mandatory peer review\n- Mandatory security reviews\n- High risk code approvals (codeowner req. GL premium)\n- GitLab secret push protection 1/136\n- Andon cord",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Version control system Security Controls\n- Git hooks\n- - Local repo: pre-commit etc.\n- - Remote repo:  pre-receive, post-receive\n- GitLab branch protections\n- Separation of duties: merge request approval\n- Mandatory peer review\n- Mandatory security reviews\n- High risk code approvals (codeowner req. GL premium)\n- GitLab secret push protection 1/136\n- Andon cord",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
